As everybody on the mailing list should be aware of by now, I have been
volunteered to collate information about which options should be =
initially
supported in LaTeX 3.0, etc.

A standardized form is under development and should be finished RSN,
probably by the end of this week, and will be spread by the appropriate
channels.

I will, of course, use the info I have already received. The more =
patient
are humbly requested to wait until the form is completed. This will =
ensure
some standardization and help further the democratic ideal that all
`votes' are considered equal.

Thanx for your cooperation,

-roffe



